{"packId":"daily-2026-12-05","packVersion":2,"scoringVersion":1,"date":"2026-12-05","number":80,"puzzles":[{"id":"2026-12-05-pattern","skill":"pattern","kind":"grid","prompt":"Which shape completes the grid?","cells":[{"shape":"circle","tone":"navy"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"blue"},{"shape":"square","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"square","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"circle","tone":"navy"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"blue"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"blue"},{"shape":"square","tone":"teal"},null],"options":[{"shape":"diamond","tone":"gold"},{"shape":"circle","tone":"navy"},{"shape":"square","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"blue"}],"answer":1,"explanation":["Every row and every column uses each shape exactly once.","Its row already has the blue triangle and the teal square.","Its column already has the teal square and the blue triangle.","That leaves the navy circle."]},{"id":"2026-12-05-sudoku","skill":"sudoku","prompt":"Fill the grid with 1 to 6","size":6,"boxR":2,"boxC":3,"givens":[1,6,3,5,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,3,0,0,5,0,0,1,4,3,0,0,2,0,0,4,2,3,0,0,0,0,6,2,0,0],"solution":[1,6,3,5,4,2,2,5,4,1,6,3,6,2,5,4,3,1,4,3,1,6,2,5,5,4,2,3,1,6,3,1,6,2,5,4],"explanation":["Every row, every column and every 2×3 box uses each number from 1 to 6 exactly once.","The finished grid:","Row 1: 1 6 3 5 4 2","Row 2: 2 5 4 1 6 3","Row 3: 6 2 5 4 3 1","Row 4: 4 3 1 6 2 5","Row 5: 5 4 2 3 1 6","Row 6: 3 1 6 2 5 4"]},{"id":"2026-12-05-logic","skill":"logic","prompt":"Crack the 3-digit code","clues":[{"guess":[2,3,7],"rightPlace":1,"wrongPlace":1},{"guess":[3,8,9],"rightPlace":0,"wrongPlace":2},{"guess":[7,2,8],"rightPlace":2,"wrongPlace":0},{"guess":[2,0,6],"rightPlace":0,"wrongPlace":0}],"answer":[7,3,8],"explanation":["237: 3 is in the right spot; 7 is in the code but placed differently.","389: 3, 8 are in the code but placed differently.","728: 7, 8 are in the right spot.","206: none of 2, 0, 6 appear in the code."],"hint":"The first digit is odd."}]}